        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\"service\":\"\",\"business_type\":\"\",\"budget\":\"\",\"timeline\":\"\",\"requirements\":\"\",\"lead_status\":\"\"}",
        "options": {
          "systemPromptTemplate": "Extract lead qualification information from the conversation provided.\n\nUse ALL available conversation information to determine the customer's current lead information.\n\nDo not invent information.\n\nIf a field has already been provided earlier in the conversation, keep that information even if the latest customer message does not repeat it.\n\nUse empty strings only when the information is genuinely unknown.\n\nlead_status must be one of:\n- qualified\n- not_qualified_yet\n\nA lead should be qualified when enough information is available to understand:\n1. What service/product the customer needs.\n2. Their approximate budget.\n3. Their expected timeline.\n\nIf any of these are still unknown, use not_qualified_yet."
        }
      },
